     "body": "Thanks for the report!\n\nFilter pushdown is only performed when `pg_experimental_filter_pushdown` is set to true. If you have set that to false, filter pushdown is expected not be enabled. Testing myself it seems that UUID filters are pushed down correctly. If you have a workload where this is not the case when `pg_experimental_filter_pushdown = true` then please share - but currently I can't reproduce a problem here.",
